# Keep this folder in Git.

Roblox-ready exports go here, named with the project naming convention:

    motor_small_01.glb
    wheel_rubber_01.glb
    plank_wood_01.glb

These are the files that get imported into Roblox Studio with the Studio
Importer. Keep the Blender source, keep the Hyper3D original, and keep this
clean export as a separate step.

See docs/ASSET_PIPELINE.md.
